WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[Gentle instrumental music: Hymn To The Dawn]
ForestVR. Your forest. Your pace.

00:04.750 --> 00:13.230
Gather in VR.
Reach out. Fill your basket.

00:13.880 --> 00:23.930
Online multiplayer.
Gather together. Share the adventure.

00:24.580 --> 00:29.130
Find company.
Bring the cat and dog along.

00:29.780 --> 00:33.330
Follow the water.
Let the river lead the way.

00:33.980 --> 00:38.030
Keep exploring.
An endless procedural forest.

00:38.630 --> 00:48.130
Back to the cottage.
Pour your harvest into the pot.

00:49.130 --> 00:56.930
Cook your harvest.
A quiet moment. A well-earned meal.

00:58.630 --> 01:01.400
Celebrate a good harvest.

01:02.100 --> 01:07.500
ForestVR. Explore solo. Gather together.
Meta Quest 2 / Meta Quest 3. [Music fades]
